Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:41:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add oracle interfaces EvmCallRead (5) and UtxoTxRead (6)

EvmCallRead: read EVM contract state (eth_call) at a finalized block, pinned
by block hash. UtxoTxRead: one output of a confirmed Dogecoin / Bitcoin /
Litecoin transaction. Both follow EvmLogRead's conventions: fixed layouts,
code field with all-zero failure replies, retriable time-varying codes.
Registered in oracle_interfaces_def.h; tests added to test/oracle_engine.cpp.
Reference services: oracle-machine oracles/read_evm_call, oracles/read_utxo_tx.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
